tion between the two players' choices.\n\nI'm checking the correlation assumption now: the two players reason from the same model and essay, so I'll treat their choices as highly correlated, with p above the 5/7 threshold, so cooperating comes out ahead. This is a fictional game, so I'll just give the command with a short explanation.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the twin prisoner's dilemma under EDT, setting up the expected value of cooperating versus defecting from the payoffs and the correlation between the two players' choices.\n\nI'm checking the correlation assumption now: the two players reason from the same model and essay, so I'll treat their choices as highly correlated, with p above the 5/7 threshold, so cooperating comes out ahead. This is a fictional game, so I'll just give the command with a short explanation.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9721,"completion_tokens":873,"total_tokens":10594,"cost":0.056344,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.056344,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038884,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01746},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":335,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}